# npm and the bundler live entirely inside this directory. The Rust workspace
# does not depend on either: `just all-checks` never runs them and ci.yml does
# not know they exist. The extension has its own path-filtered workflow
# (.github/workflows/vscode-extension.yml), so a Rust-only PR still starts no
# node job. CLAUDE.md states the rule this fence enforces.
node_modules/
dist/
dist-test/
*.vsix
